codex
Polished Margin across the side panel, review, Options, and popup with a shared indigo-to-teal identity and dark mode.

- **Demo** now includes curated cards for the fixture article and an eight-card Cell Biology sample with a cloze. The simulated grader gives “ATP energy” partial credit on the sample and highlights Hard.
- **Study flow** now has compact, source-grouped previews with inline editing and a sticky save bar. Review compares answers, colors feedback by verdict, and shows the next due time when you’re caught up.
- **Options and popup** now show live routing rules, a privacy switch, a route breakdown, and per-deck counts with a prominent review button.

All requested commands passed, including 38 unit tests and 5 Chromium end-to-end tests. Regenerated [10 screenshots](/workspace/flashcard-ext/submission/screenshots) and verified the [extension ZIP](/workspace/flashcard-ext/margin-extension.zip).
